>>SOURCE FORMAT FREE
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. CONSULTA-SALDO.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-SALDO-INICIAL     PIC S9(7)V99 VALUE ZERO.
01 WS-CREDITOS          PIC 9(7)V99 VALUE ZERO.
01 WS-DEBITOS           PIC 9(7)V99 VALUE ZERO.
01 WS-SALDO-FINAL       PIC S9(7)V99 VALUE ZERO.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    DISPLAY "Saldo inicial: " WITH NO ADVANCING
    ACCEPT WS-SALDO-INICIAL
    DISPLAY "Total de creditos: " WITH NO ADVANCING
    ACCEPT WS-CREDITOS
    DISPLAY "Total de debitos: " WITH NO ADVANCING
    ACCEPT WS-DEBITOS

    COMPUTE WS-SALDO-FINAL = WS-SALDO-INICIAL + WS-CREDITOS - WS-DEBITOS

    DISPLAY "Saldo final: " WS-SALDO-FINAL
    IF WS-SALDO-FINAL < ZERO
        DISPLAY "ATENCAO: saldo negativo."
    END-IF
    GOBACK.
